=1787794956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and master your skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Skills</strong>: Attack, Archery, Magic, Defence, Evasion, Warding and Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professions</strong>: Mining, Smithing, Fishing and Potion making, deeply tied into your equipment, upgrades, and overall progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.poster.avif?t=1787794956\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.webm?t=1787794956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.mp4?t=1787794956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player-Driven Crafting &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, smelt ore, and craft powerful gear. Every tool and weapon has purpose.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.poster.avif?t=1787794956\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.webm?t=1787794956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.mp4?t=1787794956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Reward System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster in Winds of Valen drops its own rare, unique item.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare drop chances are displayed openly and dynamically change to prevent getting too unlucky</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item is balanced, useful, and designed to have its place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/3938c6d6d958b975b03a3c2537bcd0a5.poster.avif?t=1787794956\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/3938c6d6d958b975b03a3c2537bcd0a5.webm?t=1787794956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/3938c6d6d958b975b03a3c2537bcd0a5.mp4?t=1787794956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Membership</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winds of Valen is free to play with many hours of free content to enjoy. However, If you want to expand your journey, purchasing a membership pass grants account-wide access to members-only content, expanded bank storage, and a vote on future game updates. as shown below. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/7e8a9bbdde911b9cb269225192805839.avif?t=1787794956\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras_big/7e8a9bbdde911b9cb269225192805839.webp?t=1787794956 width=1560 height=473 /></span><br><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is built for players who enjoy the open-ended, sandbox design of old-school MMOs.</p>",
